# 🚀 Day 25 – AI Shark Tank Simulator

## 📌 Challenge Overview

Day 25 focused on building an **AI Shark Tank Simulator** using Claude AI. The objective was to create an interactive startup pitching platform where entrepreneurs can present their ideas to AI-powered investors, answer questions, receive investment decisions, and analyze startup viability.

This challenge combined product design, startup strategy, business analysis, and front-end development into a single AI-generated application.

---

# 💡 Project Description

### AI Shark Tank Simulator

A web-based startup pitching platform where users can:

- Submit startup ideas
- Pitch to AI investors
- Answer investor questions
- Receive startup evaluations
- Get funding recommendations
- Analyze business strengths and weaknesses

