# 🎯 Key Learnings

### Startup Perspective
- Solving a real problem matters more than adding features.
- Revenue strategy is critical for sustainability.
- Investors focus heavily on market size and execution.

### Product Perspective
- Interactive simulations create engaging user experiences.
- AI can be used to simulate realistic business scenarios.
- Business logic can be embedded into front-end applications.

### Entrepreneurial Perspective
- Funding decisions depend on multiple factors.
- Investor concerns vary based on their role.
- Validation and traction are more important than assumptions.

